{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2023-04-25 08:00:00', 'title': 'AT&T AND TRINITY CYBER COLLABORATE TO DELIVER COMMERCIALLY MANAGED CYBERSECURITY SOLUTION TO THE AIR FORCE', 'text': "AIR FORCE CYBERSECURITY SOLUTION TEST PAVES THE WAY FOR DEFENSE INDUSTRY ADOPTION OF PRIVATE SECTOR INNOVATION TO ADVANCE THE PROTECTION OF OUR NATION'S MOST SENSITIVE INFORMATION AND SYSTEMS \xa0 WASHINGTON , APRIL 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AT&T* AND TRINITY CYBER, INC. HAVE COLLABORATED TO DELIVER A HIGHLY INNOVATIVE, COMMERCIALLY MANAGED CYBERSECURITY SOLUTION TO THE U.S. AIR FORCE. THE SOLUTION, A SECURE INTERNET GATEWAY, IS EXPECTED TO GREATLY ENHANCE CYBERSECURITY PROTECTIONS AND REDUCE RISKS FOR AIR FORCE NETWORKS."}